    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d171-a4">

                <pb facs="0377" n="277" sameAs="frus:frus1880/pg277"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 4 in No. 704.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. De Lano to Mr.
                            Seward.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Foow Chow</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1880-03-12"><hi rendition="#italic">March</hi> 12,
                        1880</date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 155.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have had the honor to receive your
                    dispatch No. 97, in which you request me to report to you such facts as I may be
                    able to obtain, bearing upon the war power of China, including the condition of
                    the army and navy, and of the forts, arsenals, and training establishments of my
                    consular district.</p>
                <p>I regret to have to say in reply that at the moment I cannot give you any
                    reliable information on the subject. Such information, if obtained at all, must
                    be gathered from the Chinese, and to be at all reliable must come from official
                    sources, and the extreme reticence and suspiciousness of the officials when
                    information on such subjects is openly sought for by foreigners render it very
                    difficult to obtain from them any reliable data for such a report as you
                    desire.</p>
                <p>If later on I should obtain such information on the subject as would enable me to
                    give you an intelligent and reliable report I shall have much pleasure in
                    submitting one.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>M. M. DE LANO.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
